{"type":"message","id":"fc8da864","parentId":"ed9c9f6c","timestamp":"2026-05-24T12:02:51.612Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"It's 20:02 (8:02 PM) on Sunday. Looking at the HEARTBEAT.md schedule:\n\n- 08:00 早盘扫描 - passed\n- 12:00 午盘扫描 - passed  \n- 18:00 晚盘扫描 - passed\n- 22:00 夜盘扫描 - this is the next one, coming up in ~2 hours\n\n20:02 is between 18:00 and 22:00. No scheduled scan is due right now. The next one is at 22:00 which would be the daily report.\n\nIt's Sunday evening - markets are mostly closed (US markets closed, crypto runs 24/7 though). Let me check if there's anything that actually needs attention based on the heartbeat rules.\n\n\nThe 22:00 scan is coming up soon, but it's not time yet. Since we're in the gap between scheduled scans and nothing's been flagged as urgent, I'll go with HEARTBEAT_OK for now.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"HEARTBEAT_OK📊 **每日模拟交易报告 | 2026-05-24**\n\n**账户权益:** $1,003,650 (+0.37%)\n\n**持仓:**\n- 🔵 A50025.SH 多头 | 成本105.31 → 现价105.46 | +0.14% | 止损102.0 / 止盈110.0\n- 🔴 USO 已止损 | -5.0% (触发风控)\n\n**今日操作:**\n- 平仓 USO 止损出场，符合单笔5%亏损规则\n\n**缠论观察池:**\n- USO 日线潜在一买，等底分型确认（当前$65.45）\n- TSLA 底分型待确认（$339.96）\n- AAPL/NVDA 日线下跌无背驰，继续等待\n\n**风控:** 无异常，总仓位10%合规\n\n📄 完整报告: reports/daily/2026-05-24.md"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":65,"output":715,"cacheRead":32640,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":33420,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779624158038}}
