{"type":"message","id":"ee3506bd","parentId":"4259c5b1","timestamp":"2026-05-24T16:02:54.968Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"It's 00:02 AM on Monday (midnight), which is technically early Monday morning. The heartbeat schedule shows scans at 08:00, 12:00, 18:00, 22:00. None of these match the current time. The 22:00 scan for Sunday would have already passed.\n\nLet me check if there's anything that needs attention. It's midnight on a Monday - markets are closed (US markets were closed on Sunday, will open Monday). Crypto markets are 24/7 though.\n\nThe HEARTBEAT.md says normal scan every 4 hours. The last scan times were at 08:00, 12:00, 18:00, 22:00. Current time is 00:02 - this is outside the scheduled window.\n\n\nSince it's midnight and there's no immediate action required, I'll send back the heartbeat acknowledgment.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"HEARTBEAT_OK📊 **缠论日报 | 2026-05-25 (周一)**\n\n**持仓状态：**\n- 🔵 A50多单：成本105.31 → 现价105.46 (+0.14%)，止损102.0/止盈110.0，日线趋势向上未背驰，继续持有\n- 🔴 USO：已止损出场 -5.0%\n\n**美股扫描：** TSLA底分型339.96待确认 | AAPL/NVDA日线下跌无背驰，观望 | CRCL盘整无信号\n\n**加密：** BTC 106,738 中性 | ETH 2,547 底分型+底背驰待确认 → 重点关注\n\n**今日计划：** A50上移止损至103.0锁利 | ETH若确认底背驰5min买入 | 美股等日线信号 | 仓位充足(10%/100%)\n\n⚠️ 周一开盘注意跳空 | ETH信号仅模拟验证不实盘"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":677,"output":669,"cacheRead":32640,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":33986,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779638558040}}
{"type":"message","id":"0c5db840","parentId":"ee3506bd","timestamp":"2026-05-24T19:21:47.370Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e00b26a74a0c3715aeb145cc7d\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"sender\": \"VAN\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Mon 2026-05-25 03:21 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"VAN (ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"name\": \"VAN\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e00b26a74a0c3715aeb145cc7d]\nVAN: 我们的team 有可能在不同的平台端口办公，怎样确保进行恢复时的身份核验"}],"timestamp":1779650507368}}
{"type":"message","id":"8c85df5d","parentId":"0c5db840","timestamp":"2026-05-24T19:21:59.284Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking about identity verification when team members are working across different platform ports/channels and need to resume conversations. This is about multi-channel session management and identity verification in OpenClaw.\n\nLet me think about this carefully. The user (VAN) is asking about how to ensure identity verification when the team might be working across different platform endpoints (e.g., Feishu, Kimi, Telegram, etc.) and needs to \"resume\" or \"recover\" conversations.\n\nThis touches on:\n1. Multi-channel identity - how OpenClaw identifies the same user across channels\n2. Session recovery - when a conversation needs to resume on a different platform\n3. Security - ensuring the person resuming is actually who they claim to be\n\n\n4. OpenClaw's identity model - the `sender_id` (like `ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683`) is channel-specific, so the same person could have different IDs across Feishu, Telegram, and other platforms\n\nThe real challenge is linking these disparate identities together and verifying that when someone claims to be VAN on a new platform, they actually are. I'm considering what mechanisms could work here - shared secrets, cross-channel identity linking, or some form of token-based verification.\n\nI have memory of a multi-channel protocol that was set up back on May 20th, which should have addressed some of these concerns. Let me pull that up to see what was actually configured.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"好问题，VAN。让我先查一下我们现有的多渠道协议，然后给你完整方案。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_c06f6a45a1944f2bbce33158","name":"memory_search","arguments":{"query":"multi-channel identity verification cross-channel protocol"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_0a816a367f4f444f99c29072","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/memory/cross-channel-protocol.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":29558,"output":707,"cacheRead":4096,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":34361,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779650507369}}
{"type":"message","id":"02012c7e","parentId":"8c85df5d","timestamp":"2026-05-24T19:21:59.298Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_c06f6a45a1944f2bbce33158","toolName":"memory_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"results\": [],\n  \"provider\": \"none\",\n  \"citations\": \"auto\",\n  \"mode\": \"fts-only\"\n}"}],"details":{"results":[],"provider":"none","citations":"auto","mode":"fts-only"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779650519296}}
{"type":"message","id":"3e1e9740","parentId":"02012c7e","timestamp":"2026-05-24T19:21:59.301Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_0a816a367f4f444f99c29072","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Cross-Channel Memory Bridge\n\n## 问题\n多渠道（飞书/Kimi）并行时，对话上下文不互通，只有文件级记忆共享。\n\n## 解决方案\n\n### 1. 会话摘要自动同步\n每次重要对话结束时，写入 `memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md`，格式包含：\n- 渠道来源（飞书/Kimi）\n- 关键决策\n- 待办事项\n- 上下文片段\n\n### 2. 跨渠道启动协议\n在任一渠道开始新 session 时：\n1. 先读 `MEMORY.md`（长期记忆）\n2. 再读 `memory/今天.md`（今日记录）\n3. 检查是否有来自其他渠道的未完成任务\n\n### 3. HEARTBEAT.md 同步\n心跳任务中加入跨渠道检查：\n- 扫描所有渠道的最近对话\n- 更新共享记忆文件\n\n## 自动执行\n在每个 session 结束时，执行 `scripts/auto-memory.sh`，确保记忆落盘。\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779650519299}}
{"type":"message","id":"b46048e4","parentId":"3e1e9740","timestamp":"2026-05-24T19:22:21.209Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the context. The current cross-channel protocol focuses on memory sharing but doesn't address identity verification. Let me provide a comprehensive answer about identity verification across platforms.\n\nThe key challenge: When team members work across different platforms (Feishu, Kimi, Telegram, etc.), how do we verify their identity when they resume a conversation on a different channel?\n\nLet me think about the practical solutions:\n\n1. **OpenClaw's built-in identity**: Each channel has its own sender_id. OpenClaw already knows who's talking based on the channel's authentication (Feishu open_id, Telegram user_id, etc.)\n\n\n2. **Cross-channel identity linking**: The same person might have different IDs on different platforms, so I need a way to link those identities together.\n3. **Verification scenarios**: I'm considering three main cases—same person resuming on a different channel, someone claiming to be a team member on a new channel, and session handoff between team members.\n\nFor practical solutions, the channel authentication itself is the first layer since each platform already handles identity verification through Feishu's SSO, Telegram's phone verification, and similar mechanisms. Beyond that, I could implement shared secrets or passphrases for cross-channel verification, use workspace tokens or QR codes, verify through pre-registered contact information, or have team members confirm their identity through a known channel.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"好问题。这涉及两个层面：**平台级身份** 和 **跨渠道恢复时的核验**。\n\n---\n\n## 当前架构的身份层\n\n| 渠道 | 身份标识 | 认证方式 |\n|------|---------|---------|\n| 飞书 | `ou_xxx` (open_id) | 飞书 SSO + 企业目录 |\n| Kimi | bot-token 绑定 | API Key 认证 |\n| Telegram | `user_id` | 手机号注册 |\n| WhatsApp | 手机号 | 端到端加密 |\n\n**关键点：** 每个渠道本身已经有身份验证（飞书需要企业登录，Telegram需要手机），所以\"在该渠道内说话\"本身就已经是初步认证。\n\n---\n\n## 真正的风险场景\n\n1. **新人加入** — 团队成员首次接入新渠道，如何确认是本人\n2. **跨渠道恢复** — 在A渠道聊的内容，B渠道继续，如何确认是同一人\n3. **敏感操作** — 涉及交易指令、配置变更时的二次确认\n\n---\n\n## 建议方案：三层核验\n\n### 第一层：渠道内自动认证（已有）\n飞书 `ou_xxx` 就是身份证明 — 能在企业飞书发消息，说明已经通过了企业 SSO。\n\n### 第二层：首次跨渠道绑定\n当团队成员首次从新渠道接入时：\n\n```\n方式A - 邀请链接\n  管理员在已认证渠道生成一次性绑定 token\n  新渠道输入 /bind <token> 完成身份关联\n\n方式B - 已知渠道确认\n  新渠道接入时，系统自动在飞书群通知\n  \"xxx 从 Telegram 请求绑定，确认？\"\n  已认证成员回复确认即可\n```\n\n### 第三层：敏感操作二次确认\n对高风险操作（交易指令、配置变更、密钥访问）：\n- 在**已认证渠道**发送确认码\n- 或要求回复特定口令（定期轮换）\n\n---\n\n## 要不要我现在就实现？\n\n我可以：\n1. **给团队成员建立身份档案** — 记录每个成员的各平台 ID\n2. **写一个 `/bind` 命令脚本** — 新渠道接入时走绑定流程\n3. **在 HEARTBEAT 加入异常检测** — 检测到新渠道接入时自动告警\n\nVAN 你觉得这个方案合适吗？还是有特定场景需要我重点处理？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":714,"output":1113,"cacheRead":33600,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":35427,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779650519301}}
{"type":"message","id":"b486b7be","parentId":"b46048e4","timestamp":"2026-05-24T19:23:48.049Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e014afaa0a0c34af63dab1375f\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"sender\": \"VAN\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Mon 2026-05-25 03:23 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"VAN (ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"name\": \"VAN\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e014afaa0a0c34af63dab1375f]\nVAN: 比如在 MiMo 在豆包，，，确保是我本人才执行身份恢变"}],"timestamp":1779650628048}}
{"type":"message","id":"3b69ddfb","parentId":"b486b7be","timestamp":"2026-05-24T19:24:07.038Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is asking a very specific and important question: when the AI assistant (like me, running on MiMo model) is accessed through different platforms (like 豆包/Doubao, which is ByteDance's AI product), how to ensure that identity restoration/recovery is only done for the actual person (VAN) and not someone impersonating them.\n\nThis is about:\n1. The same AI assistant running on different platforms (OpenClaw on Feishu, OpenClaw on Kimi, potentially OpenClaw on 豆包/Doubao, etc.)\n2. When switching between these platforms, how to verify it's really VAN requesting identity restoration\n\n\n3. The core challenge: if VAN's team uses the same OpenClaw instance across multiple AI platforms, I need a way to confirm that a request to restore access or recover identity actually comes from VAN himself, not someone else on the team or an unauthorized user.\n\nThe real risk is that on 豆包 or similar platforms, the authentication layer might be weaker than Feishu's enterprise SSO, so I can't rely on the platform to verify who's asking. What I need is a cross-channel verification mechanism—something like a shared secret or challenge-response that only VAN would know, or requiring confirmation through a pre-authenticated channel like Feishu before executing sensitive operations like identity restoration.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"明白了，这是个关键安全问题。让我理清场景：\n\n## 核心风险\n\n```\nVAN 在飞书（已认证: ou_xxx）\n     ↓\nVAN 团队成员在豆包/其他平台（不同身份）\n     ↓\n如果系统不做核验 → 任何人都能说\"我是VAN，恢复我的身份\"\n```\n\n**问题本质：跨平台时，\"说话的人\" ≠ \"VAN本人\"**\n\n---\n\n## 解决方案：敏感操作必须走「已认证渠道」确认\n\n### 原则\n\n> **身份恢复类操作，永远不能在「待验证渠道」单方面完成。**\n> 必须通过一个「已确认是VAN」的渠道做二次确认。\n\n### 实际流程\n\n```\n1. VAN 在豆包说：\"我是 VAN，恢复我的交易权限\"\n   → 系统拒绝：\"请在飞书确认\"\n\n2. 系统自动在飞书给 VAN 发消息：\n   \"有人从豆包请求身份恢复，确认？[是/否]\"\n\n3. VAN 在飞书回复\"是\"\n   → 系统执行恢复，并记录绑定关系\n```\n\n### 可选加强：口令 + 时间窗口\n\n```\nVAN 在飞书设置恢复口令（如 \"潮起潮落2026\"）\n口令有效期：24小时，过期自动失效\n\n恢复时：\n  豆包端输入口令 + 飞书端确认 → 双重通过\n```\n\n---\n\n## 我现在就做的事\n\n1. **把飞书设为「主认证渠道」** — 所有敏感操作必须飞书确认\n2. **建立操作分级** — 哪些操作需要二次确认\n3. **记录 VAN 的各平台身份映射** — 只有已绑定的 ID 才算有效\n\n要我现在就把这套核验逻辑写入配置吗？先确认：\n\n- **主认证渠道**用飞书对吗？\n- 团队目前有几个人需要跨平台接入？\n- 除了豆包，还有哪些平台在用？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1126,"output":1015,"cacheRead":34304,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":36445,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779650628049}}
