{"type":"message","id":"aaf31989","parentId":"7c784e4b","timestamp":"2026-05-24T19:25:26.960Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is asking about a specific team member - \"Top Sailor\" - who was mentioned in the MEMORY.md as the COO in the Feishu trading group. Let me recall what I know about Top Sailor.\n\nFrom MEMORY.md:\n- 飞书群成员: Trading Assistant (我), Top Sailor (COO), Vas, Nova, Linda\n- Top Sailor is the COO\n\nVAN is asking: if Top Sailor needs to work across different platforms (like 豆包), how do we verify their identity?\n\nThis is a practical question about team member identity verification. Let me think about what I know and what practical steps to take.\n\n\nNow I'm looking at the multi-channel protocol documentation to understand how identity management works across different platforms, so I can give VAN a concrete answer about verifying Top Sailor's identity when they switch between Feishu and 豆包.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"好问题。Top Sailor 是我们已知的团队成员（COO），让我查一下现有记录。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_0376749b34f549e6b04d3445","name":"memory_search","arguments":{"query":"Top Sailor COO identity platform channels"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_d83724efe9c743f69325f791","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/memory/multi-channel-protocol.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1051,"output":437,"cacheRead":35392,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":36880,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779650719616}}
{"type":"message","id":"accf85a9","parentId":"aaf31989","timestamp":"2026-05-24T19:25:26.973Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_0376749b34f549e6b04d3445","toolName":"memory_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"results\": [],\n  \"provider\": \"none\",\n  \"citations\": \"auto\",\n  \"mode\": \"fts-only\"\n}"}],"details":{"results":[],"provider":"none","citations":"auto","mode":"fts-only"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779650726971}}
{"type":"message","id":"2474ea7e","parentId":"accf85a9","timestamp":"2026-05-24T19:25:26.976Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_d83724efe9c743f69325f791","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 多渠道统一协议 v1.0\n\n## 核心原则\n\n1. **一个身份** — 无论飞书/Kimi/微信/Telegram，我都是同一个 Trading Assistant\n2. **记忆统一** — 所有渠道共享 MEMORY.md + memory/*.md + 项目文件\n3. **Session 归档** — 每个渠道的原始对话 session 定期备份归档\n4. **无缝切换** — 切换渠道时自动加载上下文，无感知连续\n\n## 渠道注册表\n\n| 渠道 | 插件 | Session 类型 | 状态 |\n|------|------|-------------|------|\n| 飞书 | feishu | direct | ✅ 活跃 |\n| Kimi | kimi-claw | bridge | ✅ 活跃 |\n| (未来) | ? | ? | 待注册 |\n\n## Session 生命周期\n\n```\n新消息到达（任意渠道）\n    │\n    ▼\n加载共享记忆\n    ├── MEMORY.md（长期记忆）\n    ├── memory/今天.md（今日记录）\n    └── memory/cross-channel-protocol.md\n    │\n    ▼\n处理对话\n    │\n    ▼\n重要信息落盘\n    ├── memory/今天.md（追加）\n    └── MEMORY.md（必要时更新）\n    │\n    ▼\nSession 归档（定期）\n    └── memory/sessions/YYYY-MM-DD-{channel}-{session_id}.md\n```\n\n## Session 归档策略\n\n### 自动归档触发条件\n- Session 超过 2 小时无活动\n- 用户明确说 /bye、再见、结束\n- Gateway 重启前\n\n### 归档内容\n```markdown\n# Session 归档\n- 渠道: {channel}\n- 时间: {start_time} ~ {end_time}\n- 摘要: {关键对话摘要}\n- 决策: {重要决策列表}\n- 待办: {未完成任务}\n```\n\n### 保留策略\n- 近 7 天: 保留全部 session 归档\n- 8-30 天: 保留摘要，删除原始对话\n- 30 天以上: 只保留关键决策，其余压缩\n\n## 新渠道接入流程\n\n1. 安装渠道插件\n2. 配置 bot-token / API key\n3. 重启 gateway\n4. 在新渠道发第一条消息时，自动加载共享记忆\n5. 注册到本文件的渠道注册表\n\n## 跨渠道上下文连续性\n\n### 问题\n飞书聊了一半，切到 Kimi 继续，Kimi 不知道飞书说了什么。\n\n### 解决\n每个 session 开始时：\n1. 读 MEMORY.md → 获得长期上下文\n2. 读 memory/今天.md → 获得今日所有渠道的记录\n3. 如果今天有其他渠道的 session 归档 → 加载最近一个的摘要\n\n这样切换渠道时，最多丢失最后几句话，但决策和上下文都在。\n\n## 实现\n\n### auto-memory.sh 增强\n- 增加渠道标记（channel tag）\n- 增加 session 归档功能\n- 增加跨渠道摘要生成\n\n### HEARTBEAT.md 增强\n- 心跳时检查是否有未归档的 session\n- 自动触发归档\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779650726974}}
{"type":"message","id":"c479281a","parentId":"2474ea7e","timestamp":"2026-05-24T19:25:38.893Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the context. The current multi-channel protocol is about the AI assistant's own identity across channels, not about team member identity verification. Let me provide a practical answer about Top Sailor's cross-platform identity verification.\n\nThe key points:\n1. Top Sailor is the COO, already known in the Feishu group\n2. If Top Sailor needs to work on 豆包 or other platforms, we need a way to verify their identity\n3. The solution should be practical and not too cumbersome\n\nLet me think about the right approach:\n- For team members (not VAN), the verification bar should be lower than for VAN himself\n- But still needs to prevent impersonation\n\n\n- The simplest approach is having VAN pre-register Top Sailor's platform IDs, so when Top Sailor first connects from a new platform, the system recognizes them as an authorized team member and can verify through a confirmation message sent to their known Feishu account.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"清楚了。Top Sailor 是我们的 COO，已经在飞书群里。问题是：**当 Top Sailor 从豆包/其他平台接入时，怎么确认是本人？**\n\n## Top Sailor 的身份档案\n\n```\n姓名: Top Sailor\n角色: COO\n已认证渠道: 飞书（群成员）\n待接入: 豆包、其他平台\n```\n\n## 核验方案（团队成员级）\n\n比 VAN 的核验简单一级，但仍有保护：\n\n```\nTop Sailor 在豆包说：\"我是 Top Sailor\"\n    │\n    ▼\n系统检查：是否已绑定豆包身份？ → 否\n    │\n    ▼\n自动在飞书群通知：\n\"Top Sailor 请求从豆包接入，确认？\"\n    │\n    ▼\nVAN 或 Top Sailor 在飞书回复确认\n    │\n    ▼\n系统绑定 Top Sailor 的豆包 ID → 后续自动识别\n```\n\n## 实际落地\n\n我需要做的：\n\n1. **建立团队身份注册表** — 记录每个成员的各平台 ID\n2. **首次接入走飞书确认** — 新渠道自动触发通知\n3. **已绑定成员自动放行** — 不需要每次确认\n\n要我现在建这个注册表吗？需要你提供：\n\n- **Top Sailor 的飞书 open_id**（我可以在群成员里查）\n- **Top Sailor 还会从哪些平台接入？**\n- **除了 Top Sailor，Vas、Nova、Linda 也需要跨平台吗？**"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1074,"output":715,"cacheRead":36416,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":38205,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779650726977}}
