{"type":"message","id":"2590ae03","parentId":"c60c9cb6","timestamp":"2026-05-24T19:26:43.883Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is saying that currently it's just me (Trading Assistant) and Top Sailor who need cross-platform identity verification. Let me keep it simple and practical.\n\nSo the setup is:\n- VAN (老板) - already authenticated via Feishu\n- Top Sailor (COO) - needs cross-platform access\n- Trading Assistant (我) - already across multiple channels\n\nLet me build a simple identity registry and verification system. I should:\n1. Create a team identity file\n2. Set up the verification flow\n3. Make it practical and not over-engineered\n\nLet me check if I can find Top Sailor's Feishu ID from the chat members.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"明白，就我们三个。简单直接，我来建。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_89e71964a026472c8cee47e5","name":"feishu_chat","arguments":{"action":"members","chat_id":"oc_77e848535a43c04a8f7e24cc8e65e4e2"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":850,"output":351,"cacheRead":37440,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":38641,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779650797015}}
