{"type":"message","id":"64b2d029","parentId":"f2eaeaa8","timestamp":"2026-05-24T19:29:00.114Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The chat has 0 user count - this might be a group where the bot is not a member, or the members API requires different permissions. The chat exists (we got info back) but user_count is 0, which is strange.\n\nLet me just update the registry with the chat ID and ask VAN for Top Sailor's open_id directly. Or I can suggest that VAN check it from the Feishu admin panel.\n\nActually, let me just update the file with what we know and tell VAN that we can't get the members list automatically, but the system will work - when Top Sailor first connects from a new platform, VAN will get a notification in Feishu to confirm.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"群成员 API 获取不到（可能是权限限制）。没关系，核心流程不需要提前知道——**Top Sailor 首次从新平台接入时，你在飞书确认一次就行。**\n\n我更新一下注册表："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_62194b3c149a47538616e2f8","name":"edit","arguments":{"new_string":"### Top Sailor（COO）\n| 渠道 | 身份 ID | 状态 |\n|------|---------|------|\n| 飞书 | `待绑定`（群: oc_ae78a059b1c4cd9177b2e2b4ce332981） | ⏳ 待确认 |\n| 豆包 | `待绑定` | ⏳ 待接入 |\n\n**确认流程:** Top Sailor 首次从新平台接入时，系统自动在飞书通知 VAN 确认","old_string":"### Top Sailor（COO）\n| 渠道 | 身份 ID | 状态 |\n|------|---------|------|\n| 飞书 | `待绑定` | ⏳ 待确认 |\n| 豆包 | `待绑定` | ⏳ 待接入 |\n\n**权限:** 运营管理，可被 VAN 确认身份绑定","path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/memory/team-identity-registry.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":188,"output":576,"cacheRead":45120,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45884,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779650924614}}
