{"type":"message","id":"49402e30","parentId":"e4a8aab4","timestamp":"2026-05-24T19:29:14.723Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good. Now let me give VAN a clear summary of what we've set up and what the practical flow looks like.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"搞定。总结一下现在的状态：\n\n**✅ 已建立：**\n- 团队身份注册表 `memory/team-identity-registry.md`\n- 飞书群 ID 已记录：`oc_ae78a059b1c4cd9177b2e2b4ce332981`\n- 操作三级分级（高/中/低）\n\n**实际流程：**\n```\nTop Sailor 在豆包说 \"我是 Top Sailor\"\n    ↓\n系统通知你（飞书）：\"有人从豆包请求接入，确认？\"\n    ↓\n你回复\"是\" → 绑定完成，后续自动识别\n```\n\n**还差一步：** 你把 Top Sailor 的飞书 open_id 告诉我，我就能实现「飞书反向通知确认」。如果不知道也没关系——等他首次接入时你在飞书手动确认即可。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":524,"output":247,"cacheRead":45248,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46019,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779650940124}}
