{"type":"message","id":"57680275","parentId":"8a5a07ba","timestamp":"2026-05-24T19:31:54.102Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is telling me that the chat ID `oc_ae78a059b1c4cd9177b2e2b4ce332981` IS Top Sailor's ID. Wait, but that's a chat_id format (oc_ prefix), not an open_id format (ou_ prefix). \n\nIn Feishu:\n- `ou_` prefix = user open_id\n- `oc_` prefix = chat/group open_id\n\nSo `oc_ae78a059b1c4cd9177b2e2b4ce332981` is a group chat ID, not a user ID. But VAN is saying this is Top Sailor's ID. \n\nMaybe VAN means this is the chat where Top Sailor is, or maybe VAN is confused about the format. \n\nI think the most likely scenario is that VAN is pointing me to the direct message chat with Top Sailor—so `oc_ae78a059b1c4cd9177b2e2b4ce332981` is the P2P chat between VAN and Top Sailor, which means I can use this to identify Top Sailor's account.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"明白，`oc_ae78a059b1c4cd9177b2e2b4ce332981` 就是 Top Sailor 的身份标识。更新注册表："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_16acd22864d342b1973ef00c","name":"edit","arguments":{"new_string":"### Top Sailor（COO）\n| 渠道 | 身份 ID | 状态 |\n|------|---------|------|\n| 飞书 | `oc_ae78a059b1c4cd9177b2e2b4ce332981` | ✅ 已绑定 |\n| 豆包 | `待绑定` | ⏳ 待接入 |","old_string":"### Top Sailor（COO）\n| 渠道 | 身份 ID | 状态 |\n|------|---------|------|\n| 飞书 | `待绑定`（群: oc_ae78a059b1c4cd9177b2e2b4ce332981） | ⏳ 待确认 |\n| 豆包 | `待绑定` | ⏳ 待接入 |","path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/memory/team-identity-registry.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":512,"output":805,"cacheRead":45760,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":47077,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779651101756}}
