{"type":"message","id":"3d53fc06","parentId":"adb2b582","timestamp":"2026-05-24T19:42:17.292Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e010747d0a0c33b2db2ad23d56\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"sender\": \"VAN\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Mon 2026-05-25 03:42 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"VAN (ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"name\": \"VAN\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e010747d0a0c33b2db2ad23d56]\nVAN: 比如我现在把让他在豆包恢复身份，怎样能让他确认是我在恢复才执行恢复，或开启对话，目前我在他的 user.MD加了*主人身份校验*但没有想好，这样只要恢复必加载user.md 读到user.md就知道需要核验是否是主人在恢复他"}],"timestamp":1779651737290}}
{"type":"message","id":"6267b20d","parentId":"3d53fc06","timestamp":"2026-05-24T19:42:38.649Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is asking a very specific question about a practical scenario:\n\n1. VAN wants to let Top Sailor use 豆包 (Doubao) to interact with the AI assistant\n2. But VAN wants to make sure that when someone \"restores identity\" or \"starts a conversation\" on 豆包, it's actually VAN authorizing it\n3. VAN has already added a \"主人身份校验\" (master identity verification) section in the user.md file for Top Sailor's bot\n4. The idea is: whenever identity restoration happens, the system loads user.md, sees the verification requirement, and checks if it's really the master (VAN) doing the restoration\n\n\n5. The core issue is that VAN needs a way to prove his identity across platforms—since he can't directly verify on 豆包, he needs to establish a verification method that works whether he's present on that platform or authorizing remotely from Feishu. I'm seeing how the authentication flow actually works in practice—when Top Sailor's bot initializes on 豆包, it loads the user.md file and reads the master identity verification requirement, then either auto-verifies if VAN's identity is already bound to that platform, or sends a verification request to Feishu if it's a new connection. The key is that VAN needs a way to remotely authorize access when he's not present on the 豆包 side, which is what the verification protocol is designed to handle.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"好问题。你已经想到了关键点：**user.md 是身份校验的触发器**。让我帮你把这个机制理清楚。\n\n## 你的思路是对的\n\n```\n任何平台恢复/开对话\n    ↓\n必加载 user.md\n    ↓\nuser.md 里有 \"主人身份校验\" 段落\n    ↓\n系统读到 → 必须核验是否是主人在恢复\n    ↓\n通过 → 执行 / 拒绝 → 通知主人\n```\n\n## 问题：怎么让这个校验真正\"落地\"\n\n光写\"请核验\"不够，需要一个**可执行的校验协议**。我给你设计一个：\n\n### 方案：user.md 里的校验协议\n\n```markdown\n## 主人身份校验\n\n### 校验规则\n1. 恢复对话/身份绑定 → 必须通过主人确认\n2. 主人飞书 ID: ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\n3. 确认方式: 飞书消息通知 + 回复\n\n### 校验流程\n当收到\"恢复身份\"或首次接入请求时：\n1. 提取请求者平台身份（sender_id / chat_id）\n2. 检查是否已绑定 → 已绑定且匹配 → 放行\n3. 未绑定 → 拒绝操作 + 自动通知主人飞书\n4. 主人在飞书回复确认 → 绑定身份 → 后续自动放行\n\n### 校验口令（可选增强）\n- 当前口令: {由主人定期更新}\n- 有效期: 24小时\n- 输入口令可加速确认流程\n```\n\n## 实际场景\n\n```\nTop Sailor 在豆包说：\"我是 Top Sailor，恢复身份\"\n    ↓\n豆包端的 TA 读取 user.md → 发现主人身份校验段\n    ↓\n检查 sender_id 是否已绑定 → 否\n    ↓\n拒绝：\"请等待主人确认\"\n同时通知飞书 VAN：\"有人从豆包请求接入为 Top Sailor\"\n    ↓\nVAN 在飞书回复 \"确认\"\n    ↓\n系统绑定 Top Sailor 的豆包 ID → 后续自动放行\n```\n\n## 要我现在帮你把这段写进 Top Sailor 的 user.md 吗？\n\n需要你告诉我：\n1. **Top Sailor 的 user.md 路径** — 还是你想让我新建？\n2. **要不要加口令层** — 还是只要飞书确认就够？\n3. **确认超时时间** — 比如 10 分钟没确认就自动拒绝？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":622,"output":1194,"cacheRead":48384,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":50200,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779651737292}}
