{"type":"message","id":"f1eb1ad5","parentId":"1bb0a214","timestamp":"2026-05-24T19:49:59.802Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN wants:\n1. Don't store the Feishu ID in plaintext in user.md - need to obfuscate/hash it\n2. Set a unified daily passphrase: \"元觉智能\" + today's date (e.g., \"元觉智能20260525\")\n\nLet me design this properly. The passphrase format would be something like \"元觉智能20260525\" which changes daily.\n\nFor the Feishu ID, instead of storing `ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683` in plaintext, I could:\n- Store a hash\n\n\n- Store a reference/alias\n- Or just reference \"主人飞书ID\" without exposing it, and the system looks it up from the registry\n\nThe user.md file shouldn't contain the actual ID at all. I'll just reference the identity registry and implement the passphrase system with the daily format \"元觉智能YYYYMMDD\".\n\nSo the user.md authentication section needs to reference the registry instead of exposing the ID directly, and the passphrase format should be \"元觉智能\" plus the current date in YYYYMMDD format. I'm designing a clean, executable protocol that keeps sensitive data in the registry while user.md just contains the reference and verification logic.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"明白。两个安全要求：\n1. **飞书 ID 不明文** — user.md 里只做引用，实际 ID 在身份注册表\n2. **口令：元觉智能 + 当天日期** — 如 `元觉智能20260525`"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_4f728e2a2f2b49f3bf2baf18","name":"edit","arguments":{"new_string":"## 验证口令（每日轮换）\n\n- **格式:** 元觉智能 + 当天日期（YYYYMMDD）\n- **示例:** 元觉智能20260525\n- **有效期:** 当天 00:00 ~ 23:59\n- **设置人:** VAN（仅 VAN 可修改格式）\n- **用途:** 高风险操作二次确认 / 新渠道接入加速确认","old_string":"## 验证口令（24小时轮换）\n\n- 当前口令: `待设置`\n- 有效期: `待设置`\n- 设置人: VAN（仅 VAN 可设置/更新）","path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/memory/team-identity-registry.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1227,"output":806,"cacheRead":48960,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":50993,"cost":{"in