{"type":"message","id":"1eb9c57d","parentId":"398c1d93","timestamp":"2026-05-24T19:50:25.624Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me also update the team-identity-registry.md to note that the Feishu ID should not be stored in plaintext in user-facing files.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"搞定。现在有两个文件配合工作：\n\n**身份注册表** `memory/team-identity-registry.md`\n- 存储所有成员的真实 ID（系统内部文件，不对外暴露）\n- 口令规则：元觉智能 + 当天日期\n\n**校验协议** `memory/top-sailor-user-protocol.md`\n- 不含任何明文 ID\n- 引用注册表做身份匹配\n- 四步校验流程：绑定检查 → 新身份拦截 → 口令确认 → 飞书主人确认\n\n**实际效果：**\n```\nTop Sailor 在豆包接入\n    ↓\n读到 user-protocol.md\n    ↓\n查注册表 → sender_id 未绑定\n    ↓\n回复：\"请提供今日口令或等待主人确认\"\n    ↓\n同时飞书通知你\n    ↓\n你回复确认 → 绑定完成\n```\n\n要我把这个协议也写入你已有的 Top Sailor user.md 里吗？还是作为独立文件引用就行？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":764,"output":279,"cacheRead":50688,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":51731,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779652215781}}
{"type":"message","id":"e47c8bc9","parentId":"1eb9c57d","timestamp":"2026-05-24T19:51:44.316Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e01223978a0c4c5a994ee1fa14\",\n  \"reply_to_id\": \"om_x100b6e0126fdc8a0b3e7dd2c8cef857\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"sender\": \"VAN\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Mon 2026-05-25 03:51 GMT+8\",\n  \"has_reply_context\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"VAN (ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"name\": \"VAN\"\n}\n```\n\nReplied message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"[Interactive Card]\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e01223978a0c4c5a994ee1fa14]\nVAN: [Replying to: \"[Interactive Card]\"]\n\n有什么区别怎样进行"}],"timestamp":1779652304313}}
{"type":"message","id":"9161f869","parentId":"e47c8bc9","timestamp":"2026-05-24T19:51:57.298Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is replying to an interactive card message. The card was likely showing the two file options I mentioned. VAN is asking about the difference between the two approaches and how to proceed:\n\n1. Writing the protocol into Top Sailor's existing user.md\n2. Keeping it as a standalone file that gets referenced\n\nLet me explain the practical difference and recommend the best approach.\n\nActually, VAN might be asking about a different distinction. Let me think about what the interactive card showed. The card likely showed two options:\n- Option A: Write into Top Sailor's existing user.md\n- Option B: Keep as independent file, reference it\n\nThe key differences:\n- If written INTO user.md: Every time the bot loads user.md (which happens every session), it immediately sees the verification rules. This is more direct and harder to skip.\n\n\n- If standalone file: The bot needs to know to read it separately. Could be missed if the bot doesn't know to look for it.\n\nI think the better approach is to embed it directly in user.md since that file gets loaded automatically at session start, making the verification protocol immediately visible and harder to bypass.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"两个方案的区别：\n\n## 方案 A：写入 Top Sailor 的 user.md\n```\nuser.md（每次会话自动加载）\n├── 用户信息\n├── 偏好设置\n└── 主人身份校验协议 ← 直接在这里\n```\n**优点：** 每次开对话必读，校验逻辑100%生效\n**缺点：** user.md 会变长\n\n## 方案 B：独立文件引用\n```\nuser.md\n└── \"校验规则见 memory/top-sailor-user-protocol.md\"\n\ntop-sailor-user-protocol.md（单独文件）\n└── 完整校验流程\n```\n**优点：** 模块化，user.md 保持简洁\n**缺点：** 需要 bot 主动去读协议文件，可能漏掉\n\n---\n\n## 建议：用方案 A\n\n理由很简单——**user.md 是每次会话必读的**，校验逻辑直接写进去，不存在\"忘记读\"的情况。安全相关的东西不能靠引用。\n\n你已经有 Top Sailor 的 user.md 了吗？给我路径，我直接把协议写进去。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":657,"output":711,"cacheRead":51392,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":52760,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779652304316}}
{"type":"message","id":"f2ce133d","parentId":"9161f869","timestamp":"2026-05-24T19:58:50.920Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e01c96840a0c26870fe1a6f63b\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"sender\": \"VAN\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Mon 2026-05-25 03:58 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"VAN (ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_1a64d3ea99c24cac146f8ec1b670f683\",\n  \"name\": \"VAN\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e01c96840a0c26870fe1a6f63b]\nVAN: 有是有但现在积分烧完了，扣子飞书端都处于体眠状态能么只发消息回飞书，？又怎样能放行"}],"timestamp":1779652730918}}
{"type":"message","id":"7eadea8f","parentId":"f2ce133d","timestamp":"2026-05-24T19:59:10.466Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"VAN is asking a practical question: if the Coze/扣子 (Doubao's backend) and Feishu bot are both in \"dormant/sleep\" state (because credits/points are exhausted), then:\n\n1. How can the system send a notification back to Feishu to alert VAN?\n2. How can the system grant access/放行?\n\nThis is a real operational problem. If the bot's API credits are exhausted:\n- The bot can't call Feishu API to send messages\n- The bot can't process requests\n- The verification flow breaks\n\nLet me think about solutions:\n\n1. **OpenClaw as the intermediary** - OpenClaw itself has its own API budget. \n\nThe OpenClaw instance running on Feishu can still send notifications to VAN even if Coze/扣子 credits are depleted, so I could leverage that as the notification channel. I could also set up a fallback mechanism where the verification logic runs locally with file-based logging, then syncs notifications once credits are restored, or implement a manual override using daily passcodes that doesn't require API calls.\n\nThe core problem is that if Coze/扣子 is dormant, the bot can't send Feishu notifications at all. So I need a practical workaround: the bot reads the user verification protocol, checks if the sender is unknown, and blocks while logging the request locally—then VAN can check the logs manually or we can set up a cron job to send notifications through OpenClaw instead of relying on the bot's direct API access.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"好问题，这是个实际的基础设施问题。\n\n## 问题本质\n\n```\n扣子/飞书积分耗尽\n    ↓\nBot API 调用受限\n    ↓\n无法发飞书通知 → 无法通知你 → 校验流程卡住\n```\n\n## 解决方案：不依赖扣子 API\n\n### 方案 1：用 OpenClaw 通道通知（推荐）\n\nOpenClaw 飞书端是独立的，不受扣子积分影响。让校验协议这样写：\n\n```\n校验流程：\n1. 检测到未知身份\n2. 本地记录请求到文件（不依赖 API）\n3. 通过 OpenClaw 飞书通道通知 VAN\n4. VAN 在飞书确认\n5. OpenClaw 回写确认结果到文件\n6. 扣子端读取确认文件 → 放行\n```\n\n### 方案 2：文件中转确认\n\n```\n扣子端检测到未知身份\n    ↓\n写入文件: memory/pending-verifications/2026-05-25-{timestamp}.json\n    ↓\n回复请求者: \"已提交确认，请等待主人处理\"\n    ↓\nOpenClaw 心跳扫描 pending 文件\n    ↓\n发现新请求 → 飞书通知你\n    ↓\n你确认 → 写入确认结果\n    ↓\n下次扣子端启动 → 读取确认 → 绑定身份\n```\n\n### 方案 3：口令直接放行（降级方案）\n\n当 API 不可用时，口令作为**唯一验证方式**：\n\n```\n校验逻辑：\nif API可用:\n    口令 + 飞书确认（双重）\nelse:\n    口令即可放行（降级模式）\n```\n\n---\n\n## 我建议：组合方案 1 + 3\n\n```\n正常模式：口令 + 飞书确认（双重保障）\n降级模式：口令即可放行（API 不可用时）\n```\n\n要我现在就把这个写入校验协议吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"xiaomimimo","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","usage":{"input":798,"output":1091,"cacheRead":52032,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":53921,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779652730919}}
